.\BRETT's office
>.Brett is Sonny's boss. He is a classical WASP-y guy with a
>.nice haircut, white shirt and a tie. Brett's office is one
>.of those somewhat lavish corner offices on one of the higher
..up floors (30). He has a desk with a schooner on it. 
._SONNY
>:Hey Brett, my man, how's a going?
.:How is "The Miraculous" doing?
._BRETT
>:Don't even ask me, nothing but
>:pain. I mean, it's expensive to be
>:rich. You know when they say - the
>:best day in the boat-owner's life
>:is the day it's bought and sold.
>:Holds so true. Anyways, really
.:busy, what do you want? 
._SONNY
>:You know Hemisphere Energy. They
>:called. They have this great deal
>:that they are looking investors
.:for. I spoke to...
.((interrupted by Brett)
.:
._BRETT
>:Hemisphere. That kind of rings a
.:bell.
._SONNY
>:Yeah, they are huge. Shale gas
>:drilling, off-shore exploration.
>:Really great company. Highly
.:skilled workforce...
._BRETT
.:... OK.
._SONNY
>:Well, they are looking for
>:potential investors in the new
>:shale field that they are
.:developing. 
._BRETT
>:OK, you can tell me more about it
>:later. Run it through the strats
>:first. I want to see if you missed
.:anything. 
.\DR. TANG'S AREA ON THE TRADING FLOOR
>.Dr. Tang is a strat in the organization. He is always
>.referred as Dr. Tang, as if he doesn't have the first name.
>.All his assistants are also Chinese. He has a mild Chinese
>.accent. He has at least four really large screens, running
>.all sorts of analysis, coding. He is really into his work
..and he is not easily distracted. 
._SONNY
>:Dr. Tang, how is my favorite
.:Chinese doing today? Busy?
._DR. TANG
>:Yes, I have to finish the risk
>:reports for Carter Potential (a
>:company name), then CVA
>:calculations on the CDSs. What
.:bring you here? 
>((Dr. Tang doesn't speak
>(perfect English, so
>(minor mistakes in his
>(dialogue - and this
.(script I might add...)
.:
._SONNY
