>:this really smart guy, got a gold
.:medal at the math olympiad....
._SONNY
>:You know how things are lately.
>:Can't afford it right now. It's not
.:a growing industry you know. 
._DR. TANG
>:One of my interns costs less a year
.:than your salary for 2 weeks.
._SONNY
>:I know, and it pains me, but I
>:really need that money. Golf
.:membership is not free.
._DR. TANG
>:Or you can hire one of the Budapest
.:guys...
._SONNY
