>:discuss business decisions with
.:you. 
._DR. TANG
>:Business decisions - it was end of
>:the quarter party. Anyways - I will
>:do it later. You also better run
.:the deal through Igor in risk.
._SONNY
>((somewhat dismissive
.(towards Dr. Tang)
